. *============================================================================
> ==
. * gaci_natmix_overid.do  --  MAIN + HETEROGENEITY with natural & mixed entere
> d as
. *   TWO SEPARATE instruments (over-identified throughout -> Hansen J at every
>  step).
. *   z_nat = tour_shift x ln(1+natural) ; z_mix = tour_shift x ln(1+mixed)
. *   MAIN  : (ln_gaci_cwm = z_nat z_mix)
. *   HET   : (ln_gaci_cwm  cwm#mod = z_nat z_mix  z_nat#mod z_mix#mod)   [2 en
> dog, 4 IV]
. *   country+year FE ; robust SE.
. *   emits  MNM|outcome|b|se|p|KP_F|J_p|N
. *          HNM|moderator|outcome|term|b|se|p|KP_F|J_p|N   (term = main / inte
> r)
. *============================================================================
> ==
